    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d446">

                <pb facs="d445-3" n="3" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/d445-3"/>

                <head>446. Telegram 1369 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d446-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-01-13">January 13, 1956, 2
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d446-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d446-1"/>
                <p>1369. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Lai Ya-Li (Matthews 3776, 7225, 3920) and Wang Pao-Liu (7037, 4946, 4080)
                    respectively, replaced Li and Lin on CHICOM Ambassadorial delegation yesterday.
                    Request biographic information.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
